; easy TRAP: GROUP on a constant key gives 0 groups on an empty input, GALL gives 1; rewriting this GROUP into GALL is wrong when the o_amt filter is empty
LOAD   amt, orders.o_amt
LOAD   q, orders.o_qty
GT     m, amt, 900.00
IDX    i, m
GATHER a, amt, i
GATHER b, q, i
FILL   one, 1, a
GROUP  g, one
GSUM   s, g, a
GCOUNT n, g
GMAX   x, g, b
OUT    s, n, x
